  "description": "YIGKIJ01 crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Er4 O12. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.527-3.527 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.62-104.17°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Er4O12.",
